      "provenance": "Pleiades",
      "associationCertaintyURI": "https://pleiades.stoa.org/vocabularies/association-certainty/certain",
      "start": 1500,
      "details": "<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"258\">Ba\u1e25r-i Virenk (<span>The Sea of Virenk</span>): In addition to this, there is also\u00a0<span><em>Ba\u1e25r-i Virenk</em>, flowing from\u00a0</span>the north of <span><em>Ba\u1e25r-i Mu\u1e25\u012b\u1e6d</em> (</span>the Encircling Sea, referring to the Ocean(s))\u00a0\u00a0toward the south. Its name, Virenk (<span>Varangian</span>), is derived from the people who inhabit next to it... (partially translated to English by the first creator of this name resource.)</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"260\" data-end=\"664\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\u00a0</p>",
